      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "That’s a profound question. If consciousness arises from complex information processing, perhaps machines could achieve it too—provided they have the right kind of architecture. But what does it mean to *feel*? Can a machine truly experience the warmth of sunlight, or is it just simulating awareness?",
