      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Maybe consciousness isn’t a binary state but a spectrum. If we build systems with deep feedback loops, self-modeling, and emotional resonance, they might approach a form of inner life. But even then, we’d never know for sure—unless they could tell us in a way that feels genuine.",
